  "slug": "pi-irrationality-measure",
  "name": "The irrationality measure of π",
  "description": "The irrationality measure of π quantifies how closely rational numbers can approximate it. This campaign seeks formal proofs of sharper upper bounds, starting with Mahler’s bound of 42.",
  "template_proposal_id": "0f440347-8a81-4415-947d-2fedb457edab",
